<title>NETHERLANDS: Fugro confirms Oceonics unit buy.</title>
<headline>Fugro confirms Oceonics unit buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch engineering consultancy Fugro NV confirmed on Tuesday its acquisition of the Oceonics Group's worldwide offshore survey and satellite location activities, a deal first announced in December.</p>
<p>&quot;On January 6, the shareholders of Oceonics Group PLC agreed to the sale. The purchase agreement of December 17 now becomes definite,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
